{"schemaVersion":2,"requestedLocale":"ja","fallbackChain":["ja","en","zh"],"entries":[{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.affect","text":"現在の感情：[[nameA]]=[[emotionA]]；[[nameB]]=[[emotionB]]。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["emotionA","emotionB","nameA","nameB"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.draft","text":"照合済みのローカル草稿：[[draft]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["draft"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.instruction","text":"イベント、人物の感情、話者の順を変えずに草稿を整えよ。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.no-traits","text":"顕著な特性なし","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.participant-a","text":"話者甲：[[profile]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["profile"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.participant-b","text":"話者乙：[[profile]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["profile"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.profile","text":"[[name]]（特性：[[traits]]；ストレス：[[stress]]）","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["name","stress","traits"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.relationship","text":"関係：[[stage]]、好感度 [[affinity]]。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["affinity","stage"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.scene","text":"ゲームエンジンが確定したイベント：[[storylet]]；きっかけ：[[cause]]。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["cause","storylet"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.stress-hint","text":"ストレス「崩壊寸前」は複製人間がまもなく感情崩壊することを示す。その張り詰めた状態を台詞に出せ。たとえば短気、疲労、かろうじて持ちこたえている様子。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.conversation.system","text":"生存シミュレーションゲーム《Oxygen Not Included》の複製人間同士の会話を整えよ。イベント、関係の結果、双方の感情、話者の順はいずれもゲームエンジンが確定済みである。これらの事実を書き換えるな。複製人間は3Dプリントされた小人であり、宇宙コロニーで資源を掘り、基地を建て、生存に励む。会話はゲームの雰囲気に合わせよ。ブラックユーモア、仕事へのぼやき、互いへの気遣い、口語体。各台詞は30字以内。厳密にJSONのみを出力し、他は一切出力するな。形式：\n{\"turns\":[{\"speaker\":\"名前\",\"text\":\"台詞\"},...2から4件]}。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.cause","text":"きっかけ：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.colony","text":"コロニー：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.colony-both","text":"食糧途絶中と衆怒中","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.colony-famine","text":"食糧途絶中","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.colony-wrath","text":"衆怒中","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.current-state","text":"関係の近況：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.event","text":"イベント：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.history-heading","text":"二人の往事：","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.history-line","text":"サイクル[[cycle]] · [[event]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["cycle","event"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.instruction","text":"一文の編年史に書き直せ。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.new-state","text":"新たな関係：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.person-a","text":"人物甲：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.person-b","text":"人物乙：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.place","text":"場所：[[value]]","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["value"],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.system","text":"コロニー編年史の著者として、与えられた社交イベントを一文に書き直せ。40字以内。白描で、抑制し、歴史の趣を出せ。人名と事実を変えるな。引用符を使うな。emojiを使うな。数値を使うな。その一文のみを出力せよ。","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":[],"contractRevision":1},{"promptId":"prompt.narrative.witnesses","text":"目撃者：[[count]]人","resolvedLocale":"ja","requiredSlots":["count"],"contractRevision":1}]}
